    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100694" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνιστορέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>know together</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. αὑτῷ
				τι</span>
